es the client request-scoped Promise.cancel handle. Rejected, completed and stale requests cannot terminate another request; timeout callbacks carry the same ownership guard.","search":"One immutable input-format metadata owner supplies filenames, purpose and conditions to the existing directory, home and quick finder. Literal supported filenames, pasted paths and case variants rank appropriate existing destinations.","searchScope":"Filename matches guide navigation only; parsers still validate content. Discrete paths are not bulk thermal quadrature, projected DOS is not complete total DOS, and a single thermal table is not complete QHA input."},"compatibility":{"baselineCommit":"abef4d78ec71c91687b05920654732e9f2abb903","originalProjectStagesGenuinelyRecomputed":24,"projectNumericLeavesExactlyUnchanged":148575,"projectOtherLeavesExactlyUnchanged":3447,"originalSpinReferencesGenuinelyRecomputed":39,"spinNumericLeavesExactlyUnchanged":12151,"spinOtherLeavesExactlyUnchanged":12187,"originalAntitranslationReferencesGenuinelyRecomputed":10,"antitranslationNumericLeavesExactlyUnchanged":8183,"antitranslationOtherLeavesExactlyUnchanged":5163},"verification":["Independent corner-permutation and complex-plane oracles check all64 products,512 associative triples,255 nonempty subsets and both basis arrows for bounded points.","The actual host, shared client and application wrapper exercise lazy imports, manual runs, rejected/late owners, cancellation and unchanged capture rules.","Genuine reference results render at all four stages, including malformed-response retry, immutable export, raw drafts and native NodeList behavior.","Both language editions exercise real finder/directory handlers for supported files and parser input boundaries. All original74 tool routes remain available.","The distributed archive runs fifteen Node provenance builders and the English provenance check without Git or checkout-local dependencies."],"boundaries":["This is a finite eight-operation teachi